docs {
Submit massal publik (langsung tayang + sesi word_import_sessions).

- Tanpa login → triggered_by Anonim; attributed_to Anonim
- contributor_name opsional → support_name sesi
- Maks 50 baris; rate limit 5/jam per IP + 3/jam per X-Device-Id
- Quality per baris + mute IP/device (ANON_CONTRIBUTION_MUTED)
- Response: session_id + counters + items (word_id bila created)

Rollback admin: POST /admin/words/import-sessions/:id/rollback
}

meta {
  name: Submit Word Batch (Anonim)
  seq: 9
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contributions/words/batch
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "contributor_name": "Contoh Kontributor",
    "rows": [
      { "sambas": "makatn-batch-1", "indonesia": "makan" },
      { "sambas": "makatn-batch-2", "indonesia": "santap" }
    ]
  }
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
}
